name: daily_xdr_index_lag
dataset: daily_xdr_dataset
onPipeline: daily_xdr
maximumAge: 2h
indexLag: true
severity: WARNING
description: "Files have landed in the daily XDR Dataset that the Link Analysis index does not cover yet (la.index.build has not caught up) for more than two hours; the limit is a literal because an index-lag rule takes no poll multiple. A graph read now may lag the data."
